    family: 'A secret alphabet keyed to Latin: one invented sign for each letter of the Latin alphabet, in Latin order. It was printed among Trithemius’s cipher alphabets and among Agrippa’s characters of spirits. It is not one of the Hebrew-keyed ring-letter alphabets of Agrippa III.30.',
