        notes: 'The earliest exemplar the sources report. Trithemius’s first, manuscript version of the Polygraphia (1508; edited by Maximilian Gamer, Brill, 2022) was not checked for the table: if the table is there, the first attestation is the 1508 manuscript, not the 1518 print.',
